docs {
  # Get All Stats
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `GET /api/capaian/stats`
  
  **Auth Required:** ❌ Public
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request)
  
  No request body required.
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil mengambil statistik",
    "data": {
      "total_dana_hibah": 1500000000,
      "total_dana_hibah_formatted": "Rp1.500.000.000",
      "total_mitra_riset": 25,
      "total_hki": 10,
      "total_publikasi": 150,
      "total_hibah": 30
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Data Description
  
  | Field | Type | Description |
  |-------|------|-------------|
  | total_dana_hibah | number | Total dana hibah (rupiah) |
  | total_dana_hibah_formatted | string | Format rupiah |
  | total_mitra_riset | number | Jumlah mitra |
  | total_hki | number | Jumlah HKI terdaftar |
  | total_publikasi | number | Jumlah publikasi |
  | total_hibah | number | Jumlah hibah |
}
